partcad-repo-sketchfab
======================

This PartCAD package serves Sketchfab's models as PartCAD parts.

The code in this repository (the `sketchfab_repo.py` repository plugin, the PartCAD
configuration and the tests) is:

    Copyright 2026 PartCAD
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE).

No model is included in this repository. Models, their metadata and their files
are fetched on demand from https://sketchfab.com, with the user's own Sketchfab
account, and remain under their own terms and licences, as each model states them.

Sketchfab is a trademark of its owner. This package is not affiliated with or
endorsed by Sketchfab.
